<title>UK: DB Capital Markets sets warrants on the MDAX index.</title>
<headline>DB Capital Markets sets warrants on the MDAX index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>DB Capital Markets (Deutschland) GmbH said it has issued 30 million European-style call warrants, in three equal tranches, on the Mid-Cap-index.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	30.DEC.97		 PAYDATE	19.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   FRFT, DUSS		SPOT REF     2910 DEM</p>
<p>* * * * * * *</p>
<p> TYPE	   STRIKE	  CAP	  ISSUE</p>
<p> CALL	   2900	    3100	 1.28 DEM</p>
<p> CALL	   2800	    3000	 1.38 DEM</p>
<p> CALL	   2700	    2900	 1.49 DEM</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
